WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.017
Tom hurried to the Royal Lab.

2
00:00:12.018 --> 00:00:16.523
"Cat, I must make a powder for Cook," he said.

3
00:00:16.524 --> 00:00:18.461
"It must work.

4
00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:22.000
Or Dirk will lock us in the Grim Dungeon!"

5
00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:25.711
"Tom, you have a good heart," Cat said.

6
00:00:25.712 --> 00:00:28.966
"I will help you."

7
00:00:28.967 --> 00:00:44.600
She helped Tom make a magic powder.

8
00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:49.496
"This should work," she said.

9
00:00:49.497 --> 00:00:59.580
The guests began to arrive at the castle.

10
00:00:59.581 --> 00:01:03.543
In the Royal Kitchen, Cook was tasting a sauce.

11
00:01:03.544 --> 00:01:07.571
"My sauce!" she cried.

12
00:01:07.572 --> 00:01:10.865
"It tastes terrible!"

13
00:01:10.866 --> 00:01:13.482
"Try this!" Tom said.

14
00:01:13.483 --> 00:01:19.476
He sprinkled magic powder into the sauce.

15
00:01:19.477 --> 00:01:23.143
A delicious smell filled the kitchen.

16
00:01:23.144 --> 00:01:30.957
"Wonderful!" Cook cried.

17
00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:33.436
"Put some on the vegetables.

18
00:01:33.437 --> 00:01:38.270
And the bread. And the meat. And the cake!"

19
00:01:38.271 --> 00:01:51.371
Tom sprinkled magic powder on everything.

20
00:01:51.372 --> 00:02:00.082
Even Dirk smiled when he smelled the food.

21
00:02:00.083 --> 00:02:04.622
The servants took the food to the Dining Hall.

22
00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:07.905
Tom and Cook peeked through the door.

23
00:02:07.906 --> 00:02:13.469
The king took the first bite. "Delicious!"

24
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:16.880
The guests started to eat too.

25
00:02:16.881 --> 00:02:20.256
"Delicious!" they said.

26
00:02:20.257 --> 00:02:23.681
"The powder works!" Tom said.

27
00:02:23.682 --> 00:02:26.288
He was shocked.

28
00:02:26.289 --> 00:02:29.426
"Thank you, Tom," Cook said.

29
00:02:29.427 --> 00:02:35.381
The guests ate and ate.

30
00:02:35.382 --> 00:02:38.311
They finished all the food.

31
00:02:38.312 --> 00:02:50.311
The servants brought in cake for dessert.

32
00:02:50.312 --> 00:02:59.456
The guests ate that too.

33
00:02:59.457 --> 00:03:06.357
"Everything tastes so good!" the king cried.

34
00:03:06.358 --> 00:03:12.333
"Bring more food!"

